        "id": "net-sim",
        "title": "SNMP on the simulator bridge: Minion enp6s20 and netsim enp6s19",
        "unit": "Mbit/s",
        "kind": "line",
        "source": {
          "dashboard": "Node Exporter Full",
          "panel": "Network Traffic"
        },
        "note": "The same wire seen from both ends. The two lines should coincide; where they do, nothing is lost on the bridge.",
        "series": [
          {
            "label": "minion enp6s20, SNMP to the fleet",
            "expr": "(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{instance=\"minion-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s20\"}[5m]) + rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{instance=\"minion-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s20\"}[5m])) * 8 / 1e6",
            "decimals": 2
          },
          {
            "label": "netsim enp6s19, SNMP from the fleet",
            "expr": "(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{instance=\"netsim-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s19\"}[5m]) + rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{instance=\"netsim-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s19\"}[5m])) * 8 / 1e6",
            "decimals": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "net-kafka",
        "title": "Kafka segment: Minion RPC responses and Core producer",
        "unit": "Mbit/s",
        "kind": "line",
        "source": {
          "dashboard": "Node Exporter Full",
          "panel": "Network Traffic"
        },
        "note": "The RPC responses the Minion returns to Kafka outweigh the SNMP that produced them. Transport costs more than telemetry.",
        "series": [
          {
            "label": "minion enp6s19, RPC to Kafka",
            "expr": "(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{instance=\"minion-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s19\"}[5m]) + rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{instance=\"minion-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s19\"}[5m])) * 8 / 1e6",
            "decimals": 2
          },
          {
            "label": "core enp6s20, RPC + metrics",
            "expr": "(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{instance=\"core-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s20\"}[5m]) + rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{instance=\"core-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s20\"}[5m])) * 8 / 1e6",
            "decimals": 2
          },
          {
            "label": "kafka enp6s19, all",
            "expr": "(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{instance=\"kafka-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s19\"}[5m]) + rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{instance=\"kafka-benchmark-01:9100\",device=\"enp6s19\"}[5m])) * 8 / 1e6",
            "decimals": 2
          }
